  "description": "Modal dialog component with two layout variants: 'Options actions' (left option + right secondary/primary CTA) and '2 Actions' (full-width secondary + primary CTA). Composed of a Header zone, a scrollable Content zone, and a footer Footer with frosted-glass backdrop blur. Button instances in the footer reuse the integrated Button DS component.",
